han wano the one country the  world government has never dared to  attack because of its powerful warriors  and that even a kainu doesn't want to  send troops to remember the admirals are  the most powerful force that the marines  have at their disposal the top tier  fighters they have to face people like  whitebeard or shanks the original three  admirals were shaped into these monsters  over decades within the marines so  really the effect that they drafted  someone from the outside into this  highest of positions really speaks for  their power i think oda sensei has  actually more or less confirmed in an  sbs that fujitora and green bowl share  similarities and might have ulterior  motives that go against the world  government both isho and aramaki have  been ignoring direct orders from a kainu  multiple times and fujitora even  abolished a warlord system that was one  of the government's most prized  balancing powers in the world one very  intriguing possibility is that fujitora  or ryokugyu or maybe both of them are  former daimyo or yakuza bosses that had  left wano before or when kaido took over  the country and so a number of clues  that people like my good friend mr morge  have identified actually suggested that  green bull might have been shimotsuki  ushimaru a man who has an actual bull on  his coat as his symbol and has the word  ushi which does mean bull literally as  part of his name by the way in the anime  the bull on ushimaru's coach is  literally green literally a green book  the very same shimotsuki ushimaru that  now has been heavily suggested to be  either zoro's father or at least some  sort of relative one awesome example  that morge brings up is how both zorro  and ryokugyu are introduced as fasting  with both luffy and fujitora commenting  on it yokogyu says that he would only  break his fast for a pretty girl and  zorro literally breaks his fast to eat  the little girls onigiri that helmepo  has made fun of and stomped on now after  knowing what ryokugiwu and ushimaru  looks like your first reaction might be  the very same as mine these two look  nothing alike at least that was my first  genuine impression but then i took these  two images of the two and put them  together in photoshop and you know what  it works like do you see what i'm seeing  the eyebrows and the eyes match up  pretty much perfectly the nose is  exactly the same his mouth not only has  the same expression but even the  cigarette and the grass straw are in the  exact same position the only real  difference really is the hairstyle that  let's be real is probably really easily  changed and also don't forget that 20  years have passed between that scene in  the cave with yamato and today and so if  i had to bet any money on who admiral  greenbeau truly is i would absolutely go  with shimotsuki oshimaru who also is  zoro's father and i think that that  would explain everything we have seen  from greenville so far absolutely  perfectly of course he would come right  back to wano after kaido's defeat he and  the other daimyos tried fighting back  against kaido and his armies but were  defeated he probably joined up with the  marines in the first place due to his  hatred for pirates and what they did to  his country similar to how fujitora  couldn't stand doflamingo's unjust rule  over dressrosa i mean they might have  joined the marines to finally defeat  pirates like kaido in the first place i  actually think it's quite possible that  both green bull and fujitora only got  their respective devil streets also when  they joined up with the marines and were  drafted as admirals greenball ignoring  akainu's orders and coming to wano to  see what's going on anyways would be  only logical if it's actually his home  country not only would you want to make  sure that the beast pirates are actually  taken care of for good which is  literally the very first thing he does  when arriving but he would also want to  make sure that no other pirate just  hates kaido's place which is why he's  planning to take luffy's head as well he  would want to see a free wano not simply  one tyrant replaced by the next because  as far as aramaki knows luffy is a  wanted dangerous criminal and he hasn't  met luffy yet luffy who now has a  ridiculous three billion berry bounty  very much unlike what we here on this  channel have with 61 million 100 berries  for each subscriber so rather than  becoming a yonko our big goal is  fighting hard to overtake the slimiest  man in all of one piece who for some  reason has a bounty of 99 million please  go help me win this fierce race to 100  million berries by hitting subscribe and  getting freshly baked one piece content  every single week now my biggest  argument for green bowl loving wano and  hating the beast pirates for what they  did however is this panel from chapter  where we see udon prison from afar  compare this panel here where we first  get introduced to the prison as it's  surrounded by a deadly wasteland to this  green bull is literally reviving wano  and returning all of its lushness and  nature he uses all of the beast pirates  energy to rejuvenate wano and he's doing  that to all of the country as he's  making his way from udon to the flower  capital this isn't just a random side  effect of his powers because otherwise  we would have seen flowers and plants  just spring up all around him on  marijuana as well no i think this is  green bowl actively using all of the  energy he has absorbed to do this and  green up wano and so the question really  is what will happen once green bowl  actually reaches the capital because i  personally think that he is quite  serious about taking luffy's head  aramaki seems to be no big fan of the  world government just like fujitora but  that is also true for akainu as well  there's a lot of movement in the marines  right now to reform and become  independent from the governments  including people like garb kobe x-drake  but also the fleet 