 his  powers he is literally able to take life  energy and redistribute it by growing  plants of any type this seems just  ridiculously powerful even by admiral  standards it also really makes me wonder  what type of devil fruit this actually  is my first reaction was to categorize  this as a paramecia or special paramecia  fruit being able to generate plants with  his body but at the same time the fact  that he can drink sake through the roots  and steal powers from other for himself  almost makes it seem like his body might  be made from plants as in he might be a  plant logia fruit user i'm just super  curious to find out what his actual  devil fruit is called and categorize  that and of course find out more about  his true intentions and what he's like  as a person since we just found out that  momo's grandfather kozuki sukiyaki is  alive as well if greenbull is a former  daimyo he would surely recognize him as  well and so no matter what way you look  at it greenbelt's introduction together  with the reveal of the new yonko has  changed the power dynamics of the one  piece world fundamental and if you want  to understand what that means for the  future of the one piece world you really  shouldn't miss this video right here
 

